---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Public demo walkthrough — DAJC" description="Follow a dispatcher through the public DAJC demo using synthetic transport data.">
<main class="public-info"><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC DEMO WALKTHROUGH</p><h1>Follow one transport through its D-ID.</h1><p>This walkthrough uses the public demo and synthetic data. It is an illustration of work in development, not an operational transport service.</p><ol><li><h2>Overview</h2><p>Start with active transports, upcoming milestones and items requiring attention. Look for permit blockers and missing documents.</p></li><li><h2>D-ID Orders</h2><p>Open the example D-2026-00482. Each order keeps the route, participants and readiness status together under one transport identity.</p></li><li><h2>Command Center</h2><p>Check Readiness Gates and Critical Blockers. The example shows missing permits, participant confirmations and documents that still need attention.</p></li><li><h2>Documents</h2><p>Open the Documents tab within the order. Compare Approved documents, Versions and Required items. Keeping them attached to the same D-ID makes it easier to identify what is missing.</p></li></ol><p><a href="https://demo.dajc.eu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the public demo ↗</a></p><p><a href="https://www.dajc.cz/demo" lang="cs">Video with Czech narration and captions →</a></p><p>Use test data only. Demo readiness does not replace official transport permits or approved route conditions. <a href="/testing">Register for testing planned for Q3 2027 (July–September)</a>.</p></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.public-info{position:relative;z-index:2;width:min(850px,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:4rem auto 5rem;color:var(--dajc-white)}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)}h2{font-size:1.4rem}p{color:#b7c8db;line-height:1.8}li{padding:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--dajc-line)}ol{padding-left:1.5rem}a,.eyebrow{color:var(--dajc-orange)}a{display:inline-block;padding:.4rem 0}a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--dajc-orange);outline-offset:4px}</style>
